<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- A <children> typed with a class a <children> cannot hold, which the reader's default mode reads as a C_COMPLEX_OBJECT leaf and its strict mode refuses. attribute-children.read.opt is how the reader reads it. SDK-authored. -->
